Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 24
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Shell zsh
Set TypingSpeed 55ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Latte"
Hide
Type "source /tmp/cdai-demo/setup.zsh"
Enter
Show
