Sleep 600ms
Tab
Sleep 900ms
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Type "cdai latest petalworks folder"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Type "cdai tabletop"
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Down
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Type "cdai flowers client"
Enter
Sleep 2200ms
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Type "cdai flowers client"
Enter
Sleep 2200ms
Sleep 2500ms
